<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Flora Atelier - Pedido Confirmado</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f5f0ff',
                            100: '#ebdeff',
                            200: '#dac2ff',
                            300: '#c199ff',
                            400: '#a366ff',
                            500: '#8b33ff',
                            600: '#751ae6',
                            700: '#6010bf',
                            800: '#500e9e',
                            950: '#1b003a',
                        },
                        accent: {
                            pink: '#f472b6',
                            lavender: '#e9d5ff'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght=600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between">

    <div class="hidden md:block"></div>

    <main class="max-w-md mx-auto px-6 py-12 w-full flex-grow flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="bg-white border border-purple-100 rounded-3xl shadow-xl p-8 text-center space-y-6 w-full transform transition-all hover:scale-[1.01]">
            
            <div class="mx-auto w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-emerald-500 shadow-inner border border-emerald-100">
                ✓
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
                <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">
                    Pedido Realizado!
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                    O teu pedido foi registado com sucesso no ecossistema do **Flora Atelier**. O nosso artesão já foi notificado e a produção do teu buquê começará em breve!
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-4 text-left space-y-1">
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400 block">Acompanhamento</span>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-normal">
                    Podes monitorizar o estado de produção e entrega do teu arranjo acedendo à secção <span class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Meus Pedidos</span> na tua barra de navegação.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="/catalogo" 
                   class="inline-block w-full bg-brand-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs py-3.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-brand-600 shadow-md shadow-brand-100 transition-all text-center">
                    Voltar ao Catálogo
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] py-6 text-center border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
        &copy; 2026 Flora Atelier. Obrigado pela preferência!
    </footer>

</body>
</html>